    {
      "id": "claim_959fded81eca4ef99c2b00893f651783",
      "statement": "The tray runs as its own process (many-ai-cli tray) rather than inside serve so the tray icon outlives the Hub; it opens no window, emits no OS-level notifications, and uses a named mutex to keep itself to a single instance, resolving and opening the existing Hub's URL on a second launch instead of spawning a duplicate icon.",
