      "statement": "uninstall.Run removes the entire ~/.many-ai-cli data directory with os.RemoveAll, which does not follow symlinks (verified by TestRemoveDataDirDoesNotFollowFileSymlink and TestRemoveDataDirDoesNotFollowDirectoryJunction), and removes autostart registration unconditionally regardless of the --purge flag, since a lingering autostart entry runs on every login rather than sitting inert like a desktop icon.",
